Section 3
OLD_SECTION
                }else{
                    // Redirect to Auth page
                    location.assign(routeProperties.authURL);
                }


NEW_SECTION
                }else{
                    // Redirect to Auth page
                    location.assign(routeProperties.properties.authURL);
                }


REASON
Redirect for a protected route reached by an SPA link click read routeProperties.authURL, which doesn't exist (the route's settings are under routeProperties.properties), so signed-out users were sent to /undefined.

